# Optional rclone filter rules for this destination's sync (rename to filters.txt to activate;
# leave absent for no filtering). Passed to `rclone sync` via --filter-from. Only affects
# remote-backup-sync/-dry, not the mount commands.
#
# One rule per line, "+" to include, "-" to exclude, evaluated top to bottom, first match wins.
# Full syntax: https://rclone.org/filtering/
#
# Examples:
# - /node_modules/**
# - *.tmp
# - .DS_Store
# + *.important
# - *

